#   core      #0adcc8  established: the pile, the default action
#   tip       #ff3ce6  the growing edge: the newest shot, and nothing else
#   dormant   #26363c  present but idle: edges, resting controls
#   dim       #546a70  wayfinding: labels, hints
#   text      #bed6d8  primary text, never pure white
#   alarm     #ff5c5c  used once, for a failure
# No glows or gradients; depth comes from value and a 1px edge.
